 ~[render_reading_fences]: "&[obsidian-spw] — markdown code block renderer for ```spw fences in reading view"
 ~[lsp_process_manager]: "&[obsidian-spw] — LSP subprocess manager: spawn spw-lsp, JSON-RPC 2.0 stdio bridge, lifecycle management"
 ~[concepts_leaf_view]: "&[obsidian-spw] — Concepts leaf view: annotation index, grouping, density bars, co-occurrence"
